  "details": "After I exit VRChat my content cache won't clear even with the manual clearing, I've had plenty of other Quest 2 users have the same issues, and it does cause the low memory issues with quest 2, Even just being in a world by myself I'll get the low memory issue, and unfortunately, I have to clear my entire app data to clear the cache out which ends up deleting all my settings and customizations for my avatars and my UI menu, I'd appreciate if this could be fixed, Cause deleting my preloads doesn't even help with the content cache",
